        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, onshore pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, onshore pipeline, long distance
Infrastructure requirements are based on estimated standard capacity. UUID=e62fee97-6b0e-3e96-ba63-b6fc3cabe81f
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of Angolan natural gas in an onshore pipeline.
Location: The data for emissions are based on European data and for energy requirements on German data.
Technology: Long-distance transport onshore with  average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 2006, the data for energy requirements from 2001
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e62fee97-6b0e-3e96-ba63-b6fc3cabe81f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
